+# Public HTTP API, v1
+
+Consumed by the mobile app. The contract rules are in `docs/architecture.md`.
+
+Every field has one shape: a list is always an array, even with one element or none.
+
+## GET /v1/orders/:id
+
+| Field | Type | Meaning |
+|---|---|---|
+| `id` | string | order id, `ord_…` |
+| `status` | string | payment state: `unpaid`, `paid` or `refunded` |
+| `total` | integer | order total in cents |
+| `items` | array | `{ sku, qty, priceCents }` |
+
+## GET /v1/products/:sku
+
+| Field | Type | Meaning |
+|---|---|---|
+| `sku` | string | |
+| `name` | string | |
+| `priceCents` | integer | price in cents |
+| `tags` | array of strings | may be empty |
+
+## GET /v1/customers/:id
+
+| Field | Type | Meaning |
+|---|---|---|
+| `id` | string | customer id, `cus_…` |
+| `name` | string | full name |
