+# Events
+
+Published on the in-process bus (`src/infra/bus.js`) and forwarded to the data warehouse.
+Every payload carries `version`.
+
+| Event | Version | Publisher | Payload | Consumers |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `order.placed` | 1 | orders | `orderId`, `customerId` (account id, `cus_…`), `total` (cents) | billing, warehouse |
+| `order.updated` | 1 | orders | `orderId`, `status` (payment state: `unpaid`, `paid`, `refunded`) | billing, warehouse |
+| `invoice.issued` | 1 | billing | `invoiceId`, `orderId`, `customerId` (account id) | warehouse |
